    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1991387409343476003",
      "url": "https://x.com/OhmPoon_PHfc819/status/1991387409343476003",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/OhmPoon_PHfc819/status/1991387409343476003",
      "text": "💖 FINAL DONATION UPDATE – NOVEMBER 20, 2025 💖\n\nHello, OhmPoon PH family! This is the last update for this donation drive, and we are officially closing it. 🥰\n\nThanks to everyone who contributed, we’ve reached ₱18,328, and your generosity has made a real difference. 💖 While we may not have fully reached our goal, the overall total still accommodates all the latest support, and the remaining funds from this drive will be forwarded to Poon’s Birthday Party Project, managed by his official FC, to help make his celebration extra special. 🎂💙\n\nWe truly appreciate every single donation — your support has helped us bring our projects to life and share our love for Ohm & Poon in meaningful ways. 🌟\n\n✨ Next Steps: Today, we will be dropping the details for two new separate donation drives:\n1️⃣ Poon’s Birthday Gift Project – Let’s make his day unforgettable! 🎁\n2️⃣ MRS Food Support Project – Continuing to spread care and love in support of our boys. 💌\n\n💌 Thank you to all our donors, including those who prefer to remain anonymous — your support means so much and has helped make this drive a success.\n\n📌 Donation Breakdown: The full breakdown for this drive will be posted at the end of the month.\n\nStay tuned for details on how to donate the new drives! Thank you again for being part of this journey and for your continued support. 💖\n\n#ProjectOP_LoveInAction #OhmPoonPH #OhmPoon #โอห์มปูน #OhmThitiwat #poon_mit12",
